                            "To use the Neural Amp Modeler for modeling, you must first download some models:\n- Audition/Download from:  tone3000.com\n- In this UI, Click File Manager (bottom left)\n- Click \"NAM Models\" folder\n- Click Upload, select files previously downloaded from tone3000.com\n- On pi-Stomp: System Menu > Restart sound engine\n- Now you should be able to select the .nam files in the NAM plugin",
